  - toric variety
  - projective normality
  - Lean 4
abstract: >-
  We prove Oda's conjecture unconditionally for smooth lattice polytopes in
  dimension three with seven facets: every such polytope has the integer
  decomposition property. With the known case of at most six facets, the
  conjecture holds for every smooth lattice 3-polytope with at most seven
  facets.
